          <p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">{t(lang, "七张评分表，剥掉各家术语，考的是同一条路——这就是 D1–D6 的来历。", "Seven mark schemes; strip the vocabulary and they test one path. That's where D1–D6 comes from.")}</p>
